*> PURPOSE : SHIPPING CHARGES RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-02-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 428
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB SHPNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0010.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> PACKAGE WEIGHT IN KG
    05 PARCEL-WT          PIC 9(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> SHIPPING CHARGE
    05 DELIV-FEE          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2000-WEIGHT-BAND
    DISPLAY "DELIV-FEE=" DELIV-FEE
    STOP RUN.
2000-WEIGHT-BAND.
    *> LIGHT PARCEL
    IF PARCEL-WT <= 5
        MOVE 5 TO DELIV-FEE
    ELSE
        *> MEDIUM PARCEL
        IF PARCEL-WT LESS THAN OR EQUAL TO 10
            MOVE 12 TO DELIV-FEE
        ELSE
            COMPUTE DELIV-FEE = PARCEL-WT * 1.10
        END-IF
    END-IF.
